[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429214\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429576\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429423\">5550A12</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a, 1b) from the ignition\nswitch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428410\">H1A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428413\">H1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Use a drift and undo the headless bolts (2a); remove the ignition\nswitch (2b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Work carefully to avoid knocking\nthe Air Bag or producing excessive vibrations.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045016.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the ignition switch\nis not damaged.</p><p>Position the ignition switch</p><p>Screw in the two new special bolts until\nthe head breaks.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections .</p><p><a href=\"#/2429423\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429576\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429214\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a></p><p>Check the operation of the electrical system\nand the steering lock.</p>"]]